# Paths an AI agent must not hand-edit, because a generator owns them and the next
# `make generate` would silently discard the edit.
#
# This file itself is hand-authored — nothing generates it. Add a path here only when a
# build step writes it; a file that is merely sensitive does not belong in this list,
# because the rule this encodes is "your edit will not survive", not "be careful".

# Generated by `make generate` from agent-mesh-flows/shared/library/ (see Makefile)
internal/cli/library_reference.txt

# Generated by tools/skillgen from skills/ (gitignored → regenerated on clone)
.cursor/rules/

# NOT listed, deliberately:
#   internal/cli/dva_guide_template.txt — hand-authored and git-tracked; only ai_docs.go
#     embeds it. Listing it would forbid the sole way it can be maintained.
